  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After activating the radial menu by pressing buttons on the right controller's panel, I observed an erroneous persistent locking of the in-game thumb state to \"touching controller panel button/joystick\". This critical input misinterpretation disrupts gesture-based facial expression switching functionality. Through systematic reproduction, I've confirmed this is not a rigging/avatar-related issue but rather stems from inherent client-side logic flaws.\n\nEnvironment:\n\nHMD: Pimax 8K Plus (Latest pimaxplay 1.37.01.01 )\n\nControllers: Valve Index controller\n\nRuntime: SteamVR 2.8.8 (Updated 2025.2.18)\n\nRepro Steps:\n\nOpen radial menu via A/B buttons\n\nMaintain natural thumb position\n\nObserve touch state retention\n\nVerify expression system malfunction",
